type: software
title: scigantic-headers
abstract: "Decode scientific file headers (cryo-EM, light microscopy, tabular, flow cytometry, mass spectrometry, sequencing, structural biology) into typed fields. Pure Python with no dependencies, with bounded readers that follow internal pointers without downloading the file."
